<heading>joins add - Add an account to a group.</heading>

<rule/>

<heading level="2">
Usage
</heading>

<pre>
  add ACCOUNT GROUP
</pre>

<heading level="2">
Description
</heading>

<paragraph>
Adds an account to a group, creating a membership relation.
The account inherits all permissions granted to the group.
</paragraph>

<heading level="2">
Examples
</heading>

<pre>
add admin admins
  Add the admin account to the admins group.
</pre>

<heading level="2">
See also
</heading>

<paragraph>
remove, accounts, groups
</paragraph>
